            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"vacuum-family-and-actual-ibp-reduction\">Vacuum family and actual IBP reduction</h2></span><section class=\"feynkit-integral-family\" style=\"max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto\"><strong>Integral family</strong><div><strong>Loop momenta:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">K<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>0<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div>, <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">K<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>1<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></div><div><strong>External momenta:</strong> <em>none</em></div><div><strong>Dimension:</strong> <div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">D</div></div><div>Rank: 3 / 3 &middot; complete &middot; independent</div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:.4rem\"><caption style=\"text-align:left\">Ordered inverse propagators (3)</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>1</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-M<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>2</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-M<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:right\">D<sub>3</sub></th><td style=\"padding:.3rem .65rem;text-align:left\"><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-M<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>2\u00b7dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>0,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span>\n    <span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>dot<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span>,K<span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">(</span>1,mink<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">(</span>D<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 175, 135)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(135, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></section><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The 22 scalar targets use a depth-two Laporta search (400 rows from 103 seeds). Its four residuals are <strong>not certified masters</strong>. Verified momentum maps identify three as the same disconnected tadpole product; the fourth is the equal-mass sunset.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='PKri-0' random-id='d5f22ed7-8ea2-bdf1-dda8-e6e591609b91'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;Residual powers&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;[0, 1, 1]&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Residual powers&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;[1, 0, 1]&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Residual powers&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;[1, 1, 0]&#92;&quot;},{&#92;&quot;Residual powers&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;[1, 1, 1]&#92;&quot;}]&quot;' data-total-rows='4' data-total-columns='1' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element><marimo-accordion data-labels='[&quot;&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents&#92;&quot;&#92;u003e&#92;u003cspan class=&#92;&quot;paragraph&#92;&quot;&#92;u003eReduced scalar expression before loop measures (in i e\u2074 units)&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&#92;u003c/span&#92;u003e&quot;]' data-multiple='false'><div><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>140/9\u00b7D\u00b7M\u00b7Nf\u00b7V-566/81\u00b7D\u00b7M\u00b7V+548/27\u00b7D\u00b7Nf\u00b7T2-70/9\u00b7D\u00b7T2-112/9\u00b7M\u00b7Nf\u00b7V+92/27\u00b7M\u00b7V-112/9\u00b7Nf\u00b7T2\n    +92/27\u00b7T2-632/81\u00b7D\u00b2\u00b7M\u00b7Nf\u00b7V+473/81\u00b7D\u00b2\u00b7M\u00b7V-340/27\u00b7D\u00b2\u00b7Nf\u00b7T2+190/27\u00b7D\u00b2\u00b7T2\n    +43/27\u00b7D\u00b3\u00b7M\u00b7Nf\u00b7V-5/2\u00b7D\u00b3\u00b7M\u00b7V+97/27\u00b7D\u00b3\u00b7Nf\u00b7T2-85/27\u00b7D\u00b3\u00b7T2-7/81\u00b7D\u2074\u00b7M\u00b7Nf\u00b7V\n    +89/162\u00b7D\u2074\u00b7M\u00b7V-11/27\u00b7D\u2074\u00b7Nf\u00b7T2+25/36\u00b7D\u2074\u00b7T2-4/81\u00b7D\u2075\u00b7M\u00b7V-13/216\u00b7D\u2075\u00b7T2\n<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>D\u00b7M\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div></div></marimo-accordion></div>"
