          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Generated bare UV poles</strong> (coefficient of <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(i a_4^2\\not p||)</marimo-tex>)</span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-17/12/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>Lm/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>L4pi/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>7/3\u00b7Nf/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/2/eps\u00b2</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Reference one-loop counterterm insertion sum</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>2/3+Lm-L4pi+4/3\u00b7Nf<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>1/eps\u00b2</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Wave-function renormalization, \u03be = 1</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>Nf\u00b7a4\u00b2/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">-</span>a4/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>3/4\u00b7a4\u00b2/eps<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/2\u00b7a4\u00b2/eps\u00b2</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||[Z_\\psi=1-\\frac{a_4}{\\epsilon} +a_4^2\\left[\\frac1{2\\epsilon^2}+\\frac{4N_f+3}{4\\epsilon}\\right].||]</marimo-tex></span></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
